%% ===== 图1：启动录制（窗口模式 · 方案2a）spawn exe + 等READY + ffmpeg-mux 收压缩流 → HLS（无 transcode） =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant C as Coordinator(recorder/index.ts)
    participant S as SentinelClient
    participant R as RecordingController
    participant EXE as window_capture.exe
    participant MUX as ffmpeg-mux
    participant HLS as HLS切片+上传

    U->>C: recorder:start(windowId,title,...)
    C->>R: startRecording(cfg)
    R->>EXE: spawn(--title, 编码+封装参数, stdio[3/4]=pipe)
    R->>S: startSentinel(title)  %% 仅窗口模式：PAUSE/RESUME/STOP
    EXE-->>R: stdout JSON {"type":"READY","w":W,"h":H,"fps":F,"codec":"h264_nvenc"}
    R->>MUX: spawn(-i pipe:3 视频压缩流, -i pipe:4 音频AAC, -c copy, HLS)  %% 晚于 READY, 仅封装
    Note over EXE,MUX: EXE.fd3→MUX.fd3 (H.264/HEVC NAL), EXE.fd4→MUX.fd4 (AAC ADTS)
    loop 每 ~33ms
        EXE->>MUX: 写视频压缩包(NVENC直送,无回读) + 音频 AAC 包
        MUX->>HLS: 封装→segNNN_opt.ts + index.m3u8  %% window 无 transcode, 直接成品
    end
    HLS-->>HLS: 上传层双队列容错(无转码层)

%% ===== 图2：pause / resume / stop（窗口模式，捕获源解耦） =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as window_sentinel.exe
    participant SC as SentinelClient
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant R as RecordingController
    participant EXE as window_capture.exe
    participant MUX as ffmpeg-mux

    Note over S: 最小化 / alt+tab
    S-->>SC: PAUSE MINIMIZED / FOREGROUND_LOST
    SC->>C: onPause(reason)
    C->>R: pauseRecording(reason)
    R->>MUX: 写 'q' 优雅退出（liveFfmpeg 兜底）
    R->>EXE: 写 'q' 退出 exe（音频随 exe 一起停）
    Note right of R: 保留会话；记录 recordedSecondsAtPause

    Note over S: 恢复前台 / 最小化结束
    S-->>SC: RESUME
    SC->>C: onResume()
    C->>R: resumeRecording()
    R->>EXE: 重新 spawn(exe)  %% 音频内嵌，=重启音频
    R->>MUX: 重新 spawn(-start_number 续号, 锚点=recordedSecondsAtPause)  %% 收压缩流封装

    Note over S: 移动(去抖)/关闭
    S-->>SC: STOP MOVED / CLOSED
    SC->>C: onStop(reason)
    C->>R: stopRecording()  %% END：干净收尾，结束 m3u8
    R->>MUX: 'q' 退出
    R->>EXE: 'q' 退出
    R->>C: 触发 finish + 清理

%% ===== 图3：独立诊断模式（standalone · 仅 exe，隔离测 CPU/GPU，无外部 mux 依赖） =====
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户(命令行)
    participant EXE as window_capture.exe
    participant MUX as ffmpeg-mux(仅 --file 由 exe 私有 spawn)
    participant DEV as NVENC/GPU/D3D11

    Note over U,EXE: --null 模式：捕获+编码后丢弃压缩包，仅测 exe 自身 CPU/GPU（无 pipe / 无 mux）
    U->>EXE: window_capture.exe --title "记事本" --fps 30 --null --stats
    EXE->>DEV: WGC 捕获 → ID3D11Texture2D → NVENC(DX11直送,不回读)
    EXE-->>U: stdout JSON {"type":"READY","w":W,"h":H,"fps":F,"codec":"h264_nvenc"}
    loop 每 ~33ms
        EXE->>DEV: encodeFrame(tex) → 压缩包
        Note over EXE: 压缩包丢弃(或计数字节), 不写 fd3/4, 不 spawn mux
    end
    loop 每 1~2s
        EXE-->>U: stderr JSON 遥测(capture_fps/encode_fps/gpu_pct/cpu_pct/drop_cnt/out_bps)
    end
    U->>EXE: q (或 Ctrl+C)
    EXE-->>U: stdout {"type":"CLOSED","reason":"user_quit"}

    Note over U,MUX: --file 模式：exe 私有 spawn ffmpeg-mux 写 HLS（复用同一 pipe 契约，与 Electron 侧同构）
    U->>EXE: window_capture.exe --pid 1234 --out D:\tmp\cap --seg 10 --file
    EXE->>EXE: 枚举 PID 顶层窗口 → 选可见窗口(可 --window-index)
    EXE->>MUX: spawn(私有 ffmpeg-mux, 继承本地压缩流 pipe, -c copy HLS → --out)
    EXE-->>U: stdout {"type":"READY",...}
    loop 每 ~33ms
        EXE->>MUX: 写视频压缩包 + 音频 AAC 包
        MUX->>MUX: 封装 → segNNN.ts + index.m3u8 (写 --out)
    end
    U->>EXE: q
    EXE->>MUX: 写 'q' 退出 mux
    EXE-->>U: {"type":"CLOSED",...}
